					&=&\dfrac{MN^2+MD^2-DN^2}{2MN\cdot MD}\\
					&=&\dfrac{MN}{2MD}
					=\dfrac{\tfrac{a}{2}}{2\cdot \tfrac{a\sqrt3}{2}}
					=\dfrac{\sqrt3}{6}.
				\end{eqnarray*}
				Vậy $\cos(AB,DM)=\dfrac{\sqrt3}{6}$.}{
