			\itemch $\mathrm{P}(B|\overline{T}) = \dfrac{\mathrm{P}(B \cap \overline{T})}{\mathrm{P}(\overline{T})} = \dfrac{0{,}45}{0{,}4 + 0{,}45} = \dfrac{0{,}45}{0{,}85} = \dfrac{9}{17} \neq \dfrac{7}{17}$.
